WEBVTT

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.870
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.110
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:38.950
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:43.450
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.820
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:51.400
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:56.430
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:59.100
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.300
Give thanks!

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.510
Let’s eat!

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:10.310
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:15.450
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:20.720
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:24.890
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:30.970
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:33.770
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:36.340
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.940
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:43.210
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:59.090
Someone once said...

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:08.100
There are tulips that collect honeydew 
exactly like fresh, rich ketchup...

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:12.440
Ketchulips!

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:19.880
Sweet, spongy, moist, and 
aromatic as baby castella...

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:25.920
...are the bite-sized Baby Casnaketella!

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:29.490
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:35.100
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:43.800
Toriko and Coco were on a quest to get 
IGO President Ichiryu's Full Course.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:49.980
Meanwhile, Komatsu was shaken by how totally 
his close friend Otake had changed.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.910
Then, both of them felt something!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:58.250
It was the moment Toriko and Coco 
captured Ichiryu's appetizer!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.950
If this is part of the 
president's Full Course,

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.220
I think we'll need to 
investigate it thoroughly.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.660
Dramatic Transformation!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.060
Hair Salon Barber Gourmet!

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:53.470
Is their training progressing smoothly?

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:06.020
The old man ain't here?!

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:09.290
We've only heard that he's not 
going to be back for a while.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:11.090
Yeesh...

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:15.690
Before he departed, the president seemed 
concerned with both of your training...

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:19.660
Yeah, well, here's the old man's 
appetizer from his Full Course.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:24.070
It's not exactly what he asked us 
to capture for our training, though.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.840
Toriko, it looks like it'll be a 
while before we're able to understand

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.410
the significance of that ingredient.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:35.710
Where the hell did the old man run off 
to without bothering to tell anyone?

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.660
Um...

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.560
I'm sure it was around here...

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.140
Huh? Is this...

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:11.250
...the Gourmet Hair Salon, Barber Gourmet?

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:13.950
I've been waiting for you, Komatsu.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.320
Long time no see!

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:19.420
Yep! You haven't even been able to 
come to my restaurant lately, right?

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:22.160
I was off tracking down a certain ingredient

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.360
and a lot happened along the way.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.860
An ingredient? What kind was it?

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:30.260
One that I just had to go after with 
my training partners from the old days!

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.570
But in the end, it turned into 
a trip with just me and Coco.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:35.200
Oh, really?

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.640
Come to think of it,

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:41.840
you said you met an old friend from 
your training days too, didn't you?

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.910
R-Right...

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.610
Alright! Here are your appetizers!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.790
Strawberries that taste 
like honey, Strawhoneys,

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:55.860
and apples with soft pulp that tastes 
like jiggly custard pudding...

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:58.990
Appudding with plenty of Garlicream on top!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:04.860
There it is!

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:10.100
The spitting image!

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.140
Hey! That's rude, young fellow!

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.640
I'm sorry.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.380
So you get your hair cut at a Gourmet 
Hair Salon, huh, Toriko-san?

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:19.710
Of course, I really come to eat.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:22.610
And out of all the salons, the 
owner of Gourmet Barber, Pen,

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.620
is called a "charisma stylist",

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.990
but he's also charisma-class 
when it comes to cooking.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.420
Lots of people make reservations 
here for the food.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:34.190
I'm not just "called" that! I'm 
a genuine charisma stylist!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:37.130
The equipment, the cookware, 
it's all genuine.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:41.370
I see! You really are a charisma chef!

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:44.370
I <i>said</i> I'm a charisma stylist!

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:46.940
I wish I could make as much 
with my skill as a stylist

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:50.210
as I do my skill as a chef...

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.110
Alright then...

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:55.680
I give thanks to all this 
world's great bounty...

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:55.680
Wait a second!

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:56.950
What?!

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.280
Have you forgotten?

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:01.050
A haircut comes with the food, Toriko.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.220
If you're just here to 
eat, then hit the road!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:05.090
F-Fine!

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.030
How about coloring or a perm once in a while?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.300
If it takes long, I'll roll 
out courses to go with it.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.360
Sure. I'll leave it to you, Manager.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.570
Roger!

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:17.370
So as I was saying, let's eat!

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:23.910
Delicious!

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:27.310
I can't get enough of this 
soft, syrupy taste sensation!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:39.990
Your hair texture and 
color are really damaged.

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:43.660
You must have been in a harsh 
environment. And not only one...

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.460
Is that true, Toriko-san?

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:49.330
You can tell just from my hair?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:54.370
Yep. Still, your hair has accumulated 
plenty of nutrients, down to the roots.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.940
Nice resilience.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:59.540
I can see you've been 
eating a lot of good food.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.410
Okay, let's wash your hair.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.170
The way he moves his hands...

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:41.580
That's how you polish the Special 
Preparation Ingredient, Dream Rice!

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:46.820
These fluffy bubbles make 
me feel like I'm in a dream!

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:56.000
This is no ordinary guy!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:05.070
Alright! And now...

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.110
Every single grain of rice...

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.880
I mean every single hair is glossy!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.480
Or that's the idea...

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:18.050
Ah, well...

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:19.920
<i>That's</i> where you're slipshod?!

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.120
Alright, the next course...

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.220
Komatsu, why don't you join me?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.590
Really?!

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:28.330
Of course! As long as you don't 
mind starting between courses...

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:30.030
Please!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:40.740
Why are you so good at massaging?

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:46.950
Both your muscles and 
autonomic nerves are tense.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:50.320
I bet you're under a lot of stress or 
have something that's troubling you.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:55.450
You really have changed, Take-chan.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:59.360
He really is something special!

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:03.700
Thank you for your patience! Today's 
main dish is hot off the pan!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.200
This is what I've been 
waitin' for! Celepig Steak!

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.300
And I see there's Green Goat Onions, too!

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.070
It looks delicious!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.070
We give thanks to all this 
world's great bounty...

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:19.210
Let's eat!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.520
Delicious!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.220
Just the right amount of salt!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:34.260
Celebs' favorite, Celepig!

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.260
I had a devil of a time getting it in stock!

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.130
It's wonderful!

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:41.460
Uh-huh! It's so soft, it melts in your mouth!

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:45.870
I gave that meat the same 
massage I gave you before.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.070
Massage...?! More like tenderizing meat!

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:53.210
I was tenderized, wasn't I?

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.810
True, you can tell the meat's 
really been loosened up.

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:01.220
Yeah. You can keep poppin' it in.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.350
It feels like the fatigue from 
my trip's been wiped away!

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.520
I've got a full tank of stamina!

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:10.060
It's like strength is 
welling up inside my body!

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:22.100
Wow!

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:25.570
The hair that's cut doesn't 
even come close to the food...

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:27.910
What consummate skill!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.880
And he works so fast...

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.050
What do you think, Toriko?

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:44.960
Hey! What the hell are you doin', Manager?!

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:48.660
I bet nobody's ever given you 
a cool afro like this before!

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.100
Of course not! And I can't 
go outside like this!

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.100
That's hilarious, Toriko-san!

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.470
Let's have him give you a "cool" look, too!

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:57.470
Oh, I...

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.810
W-Wait a second... I, um...

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:06.850
Alright, finished!

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:11.990
I thought it was familiar, but it 
just hit me... Granny Setsu, right?!

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:14.590
What about you, Toriko-san?

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:20.530
We look like the Granny Setsu-Jiro combo!

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:23.100
You want me to make you look cooler?

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:31.570
Brilliant!

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:36.540
Um... This can't be undone, can it...?

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.680
What?!

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:40.280
Calm down!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.280
Honestly, you two...

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:47.950
Here, Nori Grow. If you eat it your hair 
grows to its original length instantly.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.030
Thank goodness!

00:12:58.300 --> 00:12:59.560
Coco-san!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:02.030
Hi, Komatsu-kun. It's been a while.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.340
So you came, Coco!

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:07.710
Why did you suddenly drop in, Coco-san?

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.370
I invited him.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.610
Coco's hair is starting to get shaggy, 
so I figured he could use a cut.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:16.810
Hey, this is Sweet King Sea Urchin!

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:28.630
Delicious!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.870
It's the first time I've 
eaten a dessert like this.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:40.100
Its sweetness is out of this world!

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:43.470
Thank you for the food!

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:46.710
And the haircuts are done, too!

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:49.080
I think you cut a little too much...

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.350
Really?

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:52.920
But I think it suits the both of you.

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:57.350
Anyway, thanks to this, it feels like the 
fatigue from my trip is totally gone!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.260
Thanks, Manager!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:04.360
About that trip... What did you 
two go out to capture together?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.360
The old man's Full Course.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.630
Coco and I captured everything from 
the appetizer to the main dish.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:13.100
The president hid his Full 
Course, one dish in each

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:15.140
of IGO's eight gardens.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:19.840
One in each of the eight 
Biotopes... for a total of eight!

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:23.110
The ingredients for my precious Full Course 
are hidden somewhere in the gardens.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:27.980
If you find all of them, you'll 
have my entire Full Course.

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.320
All that's left is Biotope 1,

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:38.060
the desert on Regal Isle.

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.900
It's the only one we 
haven't been able to find.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.700
That's because Biotope 1 is especially big.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:47.100
The president of IGO's Full Course...

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:50.810
What kind of ingredients are they?

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:53.810
The old man's seven Full Course menu...

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:09.060
The president of IGO's Full Course...

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:11.790
What kind of ingredients are they?

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:14.430
The old man's seven Full Course menu...

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:19.030
They're all beyond my comprehension.

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:22.540
Stuff so weird I'm not even sure 
I can call them ingredients.

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:24.940
So we started by taking this bean

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:28.070
that's supposed to be the 
appetizer to Granny Setsu.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.380
And then...

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:36.020
This is the seed of a Million Tree.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:36.780
Million?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.380
What is that?

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:39.790
Is it some kind of ingredient, Granny Setsu?

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:43.390
No, this isn't any ingredient.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:46.330
It's a tree found in the Gourmet World,

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:48.730
but it isn't particularly rare.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:51.260
What the hell is up with that old man?!

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:54.630
He went to all the trouble of 
hiding that in a treasure chest?!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:55.670
However...

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:58.970
I don't know what it is...

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:03.640
...but this seed is calling out to someone.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:05.110
Calling out?

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:08.410
I don't know <i>who</i> it's calling out to,

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:13.090
but its voice is similar 
to an ingredient's voice.

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:15.090
Toriko-san!

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:22.530
I heard them!

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:23.360
You heard them?

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:27.670
Yes! I think it was those ingredients!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:32.200
I heard similar voices seven times 
altogether... I'm sure of it!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:36.640
Komatsu, you heard the voice of the old 
man's Full Course... and seven times?!

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.740
That's right, loud and clear!

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:43.080
I wonder if anyone else heard them...

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:46.020
Anyone else...

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.960
I don't know if anyone else heard.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.730
Granny Setsu said...

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:59.030
I-chan's Full Course is special.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:04.070
So I wonder if anyone has 
what it takes to cook it.

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:09.740
Toriko-san! Please let 
me see that Full Course!

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.280
Old man... There is someone.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:20.620
The chef who just might be 
able to cook your Full Course

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:23.150
is in this age!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.300
I'll leave my Full Course in the Human World.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:38.030
I pray that no one needs it.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:41.770
I wonder if I'm almost there...

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:07.900
We've got trouble! Ichiryu 
is on his way here!

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.330
By himself?

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:11.330
Yes, Kuromado-sama.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.500
Ichiryu is alone!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:16.100
Summon all the Chefs!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.070
Dispatch the artificial Scum Beasts, too!

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:20.880
Yes, sir!

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:24.880
And tell Alfaro...

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:29.080
...to pass this on to the boss.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.120
The voice of the IGO 
president's Full Course...

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:35.620
I'm sure I heard it.

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:38.760
I think I may have heard it once, too.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:39.790
Liar!

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:43.830
From the course menu that Toriko-san 
and I ate together here today,

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:49.100
the sweet appetizer and 
nourishing cream refreshed me.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:52.710
There was no soup or salad, but we 
went straight for the main dish.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:55.510
The meat restored my stamina.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:59.750
Thank you very much! Your meal revived me.

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:01.050
You too, right, Toriko-san?

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:03.350
Yeah. Thanks, Manager.

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:04.850
Sure.

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:08.190
The person who eats becomes 
happy, then perks up.

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:13.560
I feel like I know what 
I want to do as a chef!

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.630
That sounds promising.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:19.130
I know I'd like you to solve the mystery 
of the president's Full Course.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.070
Sure!

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:22.230
I'll do my best!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:28.740
Toriko!

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:29.410
Rin!

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.580
So you were in here!

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:32.110
I was looking for you!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.010
Uh, Toriko... You got a haircut?!

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:35.880
Hey... Rin!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:37.150
It looks good!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.120
What's up?

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.020
You looked like you were in a hurry...

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:42.790
You're here too, Coco!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.390
This is perfect!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.660
And for some reason, Komatsu is here, too.

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.830
I'm an afterthought?

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:52.630
I just remembered!

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:57.130
There's an emergency! Chief Mansom 
has an urgent request for you!

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:15.120
Um... Where are we going exactly?

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:18.660
Y'know, we do have other ingredients 
that we wanna capture...

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:23.860
There it is...

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:28.770
That's the Gourmet prison... Honey Prison!

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:58.520
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:01.690
Okay, please choose one 
of these three platters.

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:05.830
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:07.890
Alright, here we go!

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:10.100
A heaping helping...

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:13.870
Open!

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:16.900
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:16.870 --> 00:22:22.880
B - BB Corn Capture Level 35

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:19.470
...yours if you chose B!

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.680
If you capitalize on your strong points, 
you'll have a really successful day!

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:29.550
C - Flying Peach Squirrel Capture Level 6

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:26.910
If you chose C, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:29.680
If you take the initiative, you'll 
probably attract good luck!

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:36.120
A - Bacon Leaf Capture Level 2

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:33.850
And I'm sorry. If you chose A, you're third.

00:22:33.850 --> 00:22:36.460
Be careful with greetings 
and how you phrase things.

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:39.590
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:36.590 --> 00:22:39.590
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:39.890 --> 00:22:41.760
Alright, here we go!

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:45.830
3... 2... 1... Scoop Chance!

00:22:46.530 --> 00:22:47.970
Haircuts,

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:50.570
cooking, and fortune telling

00:22:51.440 --> 00:22:53.240
are all about mental preparation!

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:57.110
Mental preparation is a heaping helping 
of importance for scoops too, right?

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:01.150
And now, the next segment!

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:04.650
Are you mentally prepared?! Go ahead!

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:10.550
Master Patch from G7 is lost in Death Season Forest, where deadly beasts prowl!

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:14.390
There's not a second to waste! We'll need their help!

00:23:14.770 --> 00:23:17.330
Gathering of the Four Kings! A Midwinter Night's Miracle!

00:23:17.680 --> 00:23:19.380
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
